omer et \u00eatre au plus pr\u00e8s des planches dessin\u00e9es.", "short_description": "Izneo est un service cross-plateformes permettant de lire des Mangas, BD, Webtoons et Comics.\nPour utiliser l'application vous devez poss\u00e9der un compte izneo (\u00e0 cr\u00e9er sur www.izneo.com).\nConnectez-vous \u00e0 votre compte et retrouvez vos albums \u00e0 lire en r\u00e9alit\u00e9 virtuelle dans des environnements configurables."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "1080x360_bg.png", "id": "1205263993211836", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982727_1205263996545169_9148883512724487229_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=aPmcYxsnIcgQ7kNvwGsMGFU&_nc_oc=AdofZ1vkoWBMZbSaBO26oDVLP_H3APrWhvySUcvYyl0ouemRvPZVWqRQvs0XlOMX54o&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af94Nv6agCGTa3x76diGqyli2xmxCyKSaGwqwBA00AZB0Q&oe=6A26DE34"}, {"file_name": "512.png", "id": "1050334919080944", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984471_1050334922414277_3741888985697961122_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=S8yBfmIOTOsQ7kNvwHC0CKe&_nc_oc=AdoQNqmA930Rx3-_pS0U2fQgjANCTY7_jGG7aKA62Fc9Ndo_DArp9sBDW2g1TE_iwos&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af99XLClf17LKT0RMt6uJfjSOl1eTYtIb6V8Ze11ZZJO8Q&oe=6A26DF96"}, {"file_name": "2560x1440_bg.png", "id": "715429989842664", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982580_715429993175997_4462372464006952430_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=bYk9NuIUKLQQ7kNvwFaIDWB&_nc_oc=AdqR5xCpnpa8D2B4ehMxS0-1Lo6jbesUxIb2lVXytvKcuh5McXmh6qsBdXb0uLg4tWY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af9cLY58ZlYzijpX15bN5rS9AyMVvXjVTvrVTY4MkietTw&oe=6A26BC77"}, {"file_name": "3000x900_pdp-art-safezone.png", "id": "629709414781356", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://